= Plate Wrongs

The workshops of the Plate Wrongs is deliberately, offensively discordant.  Localized gravity fields are deployed to ambush the unsuspecting.  The workspace are all null-G zones but getting to them involves navigating a literal maze of gravity fields.  If they like you their attitude tends towards irreverence, if they dont like you they tend to be surely.

